  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPractice Management \n\t\tPractice Management FAQs\n\n### How to add a logo to a Letter of Engagement/Proposal letter\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 2 Sep, 2021 at 11:13 AM\n\n\t\tNavigation: My Admin > My Firm\n\nPlease click here to watch how to add a logo\n\nPlease click here to find out more about LOE's and proposal letter templates\n\nPlease click here to find out how to send an LOE or proposal letter to a client\n\nPlease click here to find out how to send a LOE or proposal letter to a prospect\n\nHelp/Guide\n\nPlease head to My Admin and click on My Firm\n\nPlease click on the edit button next to My Firm Details\n\nA pop-up will appear\n\nPlease scroll to the bottom of the pop up and click on upload logo\n\nFrom here you can upload a saved logo from your files\n\nPlease click save.\n\nHead to Practice Management > Workspace > Clients > Select a Client > Workspace \n\nScroll down to Proposal/LOE\n\nClick on new\n\nThe logo will now feature on the left hand side.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
